rect decisions, calm in crisis. Concerns: communication difficulty, egocentric, not willing to further education. Compare to A and B: A lacks stress resilience evidence, B has communication tone issues, but C's crew atmosphere is positive. So we could recommend Candidate C.\n\nThus we will vote for Candidate C.\n\nWe need to reference prior discussion: mention that while A and B have strengths, C's combination of reliability, crew cooperation, decision quality, and calmness under pressure addresses many criteria. Provide explicit facts.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate C\"."}
